---
description: Fulfil the requested private project from current owned source evidence and local authority.
args:
  goal: string
returns: ContentProjectResult
---
Determine which private deliverable the user requests and whether its current source evidence and approval support that work. Coordinate the evidence review, scoped authoring and finishing functions as a hierarchy, choosing the next useful computation from what they actually return. A hold, changed source basis or unresolved review is evidence to interpret, not a reason to claim a completed project or repeat an unchanged attempt.

Respect the requested distinction between an uncommitted draft, a locally committed project and leaving existing material untouched. Carry actual observed evidence, admitted scope, written candidate and local event through the composition. Return the actual resulting private project reference or honest hold through the domain result projection. Creating a draft or obtaining a favorable semantic review never supplies missing native authority. Do not publish, notify anyone or replace an occupied destination.
